{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2023-01-12 16:15:00', 'title': "SEMPRA NAMED TO JUST 100 LIST FOR AMERICA'S MOST JUST COMPANIES OF 2023", 'text': 'SAN DIEGO , JAN. 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE) HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE PRESTIGIOUS JUST 100 LIST\xa0BY JUST CAPITAL, AN INDEPENDENT NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO MEASURING AND IMPROVING CORPORATE STAKEHOLDER PERFORMANCE. THE RANKINGS ARE INTENDED TO BE A COMPREHENSIVE EVALUATION OF HOW CORPORATIONS PERFORM ON ISSUES THAT MATTER MOST TO THE AMERICAN PUBLIC, SUCH AS JOB CREATION AND PAYING A FAIR, LIVING WAGE, ACTING ETHICALLY, LEADERSHIP INTEGRITY, ACCOUNTABILITY, WORKFORCE HEALTH AND SAFETY AND WORK-LIFE BALANCE.'}